# EndraHome Run007: editable shortcuts. ONE per line, 0-6.
# IMPORTANT: paths are examples until YOU fill them in.
# Format: slot=DisplayName|/documents/path/to/YourProgram.tns
# All seven app slots are DISABLED until you set their absolute .tns paths.
# These names are only labels; no app or ZIP functionality is built in.
0=EndraGBA|
1=EndraZIP|
2=EndraCmd|
3=Files|
4=Images|
5=Tools|
6=Favorites|
# Example: 5=Tools|/documents/EndraHome/EndraHome_Test006.tns
# Place this file BESIDE EndraHome_Run007_Universal.tns.
